	<section_number>3.2-1816</section_number>
	<catch_line>Standards required of seed potatoes</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any seed potatoes sold, offered for sale, advertised, or shipped in the Commonwealth shall conform to the standards of approved seed potatoes.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 3-228.4; 1950, p. 1029; 1958, c. 94; 1966, cc. 686, 702, § 3.1-288; 2008, c. 860, § 3.2-4105; 2012, cc. 803, 835.</history>
